<title>USA: AMEX revises Omnipoint options expiration months.</title>
<headline>AMEX revises Omnipoint options expiration months.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Stock Exchange said Thursday it revised the initial expiration months for options on Omnipoint Corp shares, which are scheduled to begin trading Nov 11.</p>
<p>Initial expirations will now be in December, January, February and May. AMEX previously listed December, January, February and March as the initial expiration months.</p>
<p>Opening strike prices will be 25, 30 and 35.</p>
<p>Cohen, Duffy &amp; McGowan will be the specialist unit.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, 312-408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
